---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro'
---

<PageLayout title="404">
  <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="label">Error / Not found</div>
    <div class="mt-6 border-t border-primary pt-8">
      <div class="mono num text-[6rem] md:text-[10rem] font-bold leading-none tracking-[-0.06em]">
        404
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-[46ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary">
        这个链接指向的页面不存在。可能已被删除或移动。请检查地址，或从首页重新进入。
      </p>
      <a class="sheet-link mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm" href="/">
        <i class="iconfont icon-arrow-left" aria-hidden></i>
        返回首页
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
